        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI AA1000 Series American Mortise Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Grade 3 North American Mortise Lock body.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the American Mortise Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5 pin Schlage C keyway</li>\r\n<li>UL-LISTED: All locks are UL-listed for 3 hours</li>\r\n<li>Grade: ANSI Grade 3</li>    \r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4”</li>\r\n<li>C-C (Hub to cylinder): 87 mm</li>\r\n<li>C-C (Hub to turn piece): 57 mm</li>\r\n<li>Hub: 8.0 SQ × 7.3D</li>\r\n<li>Armored front: Brass, 201 × 31× 4mm</li>\r\n<li>Face plate: Stainless steel or brass 203 x 32 x 1.6mm</li>\r\n<li>Latch bolt: 15mm × 17mm/ Brass</li>\r\n<li>Dead bolt: 30mm × 13mm × 25mm/ Brass</li>\r\n<li>Strike plate: 124 x 32 x 2mm/ Stainless steel or Brass</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Lock hand is field reversible</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-AA1756-specifications.pdf?v=1691093352\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI AA1700 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial Ordered Item. <b>NO RETURNS</b>\r\n</p>",
